<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Pet Pulse Landing — Fernly</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-cream: #FDFBF7;
      --text-dark-sage: #2C3E2B;
      --bg-pale-sage: #E8ECE7;
      --accent-gold: #C9A227;
      --accent-gold-dark: #9C7A18;
      --white: #FFFFFF;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg-cream);
      color: var(--text-dark-sage);
      line-height: 1.6;
      text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    /* --- NAVIGATION --- */
    nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px 24px;
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .logo {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
    }
    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 24px;
      list-style: none;
    }
    .nav-links a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--text-dark-sage);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    /* --- HERO SECTION --- */
    .hero {
      background-color: var(--bg-cream);
      padding: 80px 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .hero-container {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .hero .subhead {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto 40px auto;
    }

    .cta-group {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background-color: var(--text-dark-sage);
      color: var(--bg-cream);
      border: 2px solid var(--text-dark-sage);
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      background-color: #1E2B1E;
      border-color: #1E2B1E;
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background-color: transparent;
      color: var(--text-dark-sage);
      border: 2px solid var(--text-dark-sage);
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background-color: rgba(44, 62, 43, 0.05);
    }

    /* --- FEATURES SECTION --- */
    .features {
      background-color: var(--bg-pale-sage);
      padding: 80px 24px;
    }

    .features-container {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .feature-card {
      background-color: var(--white);
      padding: 36px 28px;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }

    .feature-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    /* --- PREMIUM TEASER SECTION --- */
    .premium-teaser {
      background-color: var(--bg-cream);
      padding: 90px 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .premium-container {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 40px;
      border: 2px solid var(--accent-gold);
      border-radius: 16px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .premium-badge {
      position: absolute;
      top: -14px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      background-color: var(--accent-gold);
      color: var(--white);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 4px 16px;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }

    .btn-gold-gradient {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-gold), var(--accent-gold-dark));
      color: var(--white);
      border: none;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(201, 162, 39, 0.3);
    }

    .btn-gold-gradient:hover {
      opacity: 0.95;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    /* --- FAQ SECTION --- */
    .faq {
      background-color: var(--bg-pale-sage);
      padding: 80px 24px;
    }

    .faq-container {
      max-width: 750px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .faq h2 {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      font-size: 2.25rem;
    }

    .faq-item {
      background-color: var(--white);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .faq-question {
      width: 100%;
      background: none;
      border: none;
      outline: none;
      text-align: left;
      padding: 20px 24px;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text-dark-sage);
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .faq-icon {
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .faq-answer {
      max-height: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: max-height 0.25s ease-out;
      padding: 0 24px;
    }

    .faq-answer p {
      padding-bottom: 20px;
      color: var(--text-dark-sage);
      opacity: 0.85;
    }

    .faq-item.active .faq-icon {
      transform: rotate(45deg);
    }

    .faq-item.active .faq-answer {
      max-height: 250px;
    }

    /* --- MODAL DIALOG --- */
    .modal-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background-color: rgba(44, 62, 43, 0.4);
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
      z-index: 1000;
    }

    .modal-overlay.active {
      opacity: 1;
      pointer-events: auto;
    }

    .modal-card {
      background-color: var(--bg-cream);
      padding: 40px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      max-width: 450px;
      width: 90%;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      position: relative;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .modal-close {
      position: absolute;
      top: 16px;
      right: 20px;
      background: none;
      border: none;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      color: var(--text-dark-sage);
    }

    .modal-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .modal-card p {
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      opacity: 0.85;
    }

    .waitlist-form {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .waitlist-input {
      padding: 14px;
      border: 2px solid var(--bg-pale-sage);
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      outline: none;
      color: var(--text-dark-sage);
      background-color: var(--white);
    }

    .waitlist-input:focus {
      border-color: var(--accent-gold);
    }

    .btn-submit {
      background-color: var(--text-dark-sage);
      color: var(--bg-cream);
      border: none;
      padding: 14px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      border-radius: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background-color 0.2s;
    }

    .btn-submit:hover {
      background-color: #1E2B1E;
    }

    .success-panel {
      display: none;
      padding: 20px 0;
    }
    .success-panel h4 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      color: var(--text-dark-sage);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    /* --- FOOTER --- */
    footer {
      padding: 40px 24px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--bg-pale-sage);
      background-color: var(--bg-cream);
    }

    /* --- RESPONSIVE LAYOUTS --- */
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .features-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 24px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .hero h1 { font-size: 2.25rem; }
      .cta-group { flex-direction: column; }
      .btn { width: 100%; }
      nav { flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
      .modal-card { padding: 30px 20px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <nav>
    <div class="logo">Fernly</div>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="#">Features</a></li>
      <li><a href="#">Premium</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-container">
      <h1>Your Pet's Complete Wellness Dashboard</h1>
      <p class="subhead">A secure mobile dashboard to track your pet's health history, manage prescriptions, and export instant reports for your clinic.</p>
      <div class="cta-group">
        <button class="btn btn-primary trigger-waitlist">Create Free Account</button>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary">Learn How It Works</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="features">
    <div class="features-container">
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>Medical Logging</h3>
          <p>Keep a definitive timeline of veterinary diagnoses, prescriptions, and historical clinic visits.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>Smart Reminders</h3>
          <p>Never miss a dose. Get tailored, timely notifications for upcoming medication windows and vaccinations.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>Vet Reports</h3>
          <p>Compile and export encrypted health summaries directly to your clinic ahead of your next checkup.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="premium-teaser">
    <div class="premium-container">
      <span class="premium-badge">Premium Tier</span>
      <h2>Upgrade to Pro</h2>
      <p>Unlock advanced syncing, historical charts, and continuous backup for your pet's entire medical background.</p>
      <button class="btn btn-gold-gradient trigger-waitlist">Upgrade Your Plan</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ SECTION -->
  <section class="faq">
    <div class="faq-container">

